{"3960760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Enlighted", "steam_appid": 3960760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlighted is an adventure RPG game set in mysterious dungeons shrouded in eternal darkness. A dungeon is waiting for you and it's different every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover what lurks in the dungeons<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/6350ebb4a1d245c38484c3cba1e01c58.poster.avif?t=1787914091\" width=780 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/6350ebb4a1d245c38484c3cba1e01c58.webm?t=1787914091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/6350ebb4a1d245c38484c3cba1e01c58.mp4?t=1787914091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After hearing the prophecy, you decide to confront the eternal darkness. How deep must you descend to fulfill the prophecy? Explore shadow-shrouded dungeons, finding mysterious potions, scrolls, and magic books. Learn their effects and use them to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop your equipment and character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/fc63cd1e1a2ec2bddedd605e0becf353.poster.avif?t=1787914091\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/fc63cd1e1a2ec2bddedd605e0becf353.webm?t=1787914091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique equipment by defeating corrupted enemies and solving dark puzzles. Develop and adapt your character to increasingly difficult enemy types. Be quick, as each floor slowly descends into darkness, attracting more dangers. Explore dark dungeons and discover what lurks at the very bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete each level of the dungeon before it gets completely dark!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker?t=1787914091\" /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlighted is an adventure RPG game set in mysterious dungeons shrouded in eternal darkness. A dungeon is waiting for you and it's different every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover what lurks in the dungeons<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/6350ebb4a1d245c38484c3cba1e01c58.poster.avif?t=1787914091\" width=780 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/6350ebb4a1d245c38484c3cba1e01c58.webm?t=1787914091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/6350ebb4a1d245c38484c3cba1e01c58.mp4?t=1787914091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After hearing the prophecy, you decide to confront the eternal darkness. How deep must you descend to fulfill the prophecy? Explore shadow-shrouded dungeons, finding mysterious potions, scrolls, and magic books. Learn their effects and use them to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop your equipment and character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/fc63cd1e1a2ec2bddedd605e0becf353.poster.avif?t=1787914091\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/fc63cd1e1a2ec2bddedd605e0becf353.webm?t=1787914091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique equipment by defeating corrupted enemies and solving dark puzzles. Develop and adapt your character to increasingly difficult enemy types. Be quick, as each floor slowly descends into darkness, attracting more dangers. Explore dark dungeons and discover what lurks at the very bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete each level of the dungeon before it gets completely dark!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker?t=1787914091\" /></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore dungeons to find mysterious potions, scrolls, and books. Collect legendary equipment and discover what lurks at the very bottom of the dungeon. Conquer the levels of the dungeon before it goes completely dark!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/78d4fdc58fafad7e4a6c7856eadb6edbf311e05c/header.jpg?t=1787914091", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/495c4f50e336428975aa97451b839b1fcc6ae3aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787914091", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960760/495c4f50e336428975aa97451b839b1fcc6ae3aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787914091", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "